  "raw_meta_yaml": "schema_version: 1\n\ncontext:\n  version: \"0.1.2\"\n\npackage:\n  name: mujoco-robotics-uri\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  - url: https://github.com/gbionics/mujoco-robotics-uri/archive/refs/tags/v${{ version }}.tar.gz\n    sha256: 62c27e459a1e5c9e9e3f9ca886890c8c1d73bacfffd4ce1f7d77868b7d77dead\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n  script:\n    file: build\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - ${{ compiler('cxx') }}\n    - ${{ stdlib('c') }}\n    - cmake >=3.26\n    - ninja\n  # The library always build against libmujoco, and then\n  # has specific logic to handle ABI changes acroos mujoco versions, hence\n  # why we ignore the tight run_exports of libmujoco. In case a new mujoco\n  # version will change the ABI in a way not handled by a given release,\n  # repodata patches will be used to limit the maximum mujoco version for\n  # already released version of mujoco-robotics-uri\n  host:\n    - libmujoco 3.12.*\n    - libresolve-robotics-uri-cpp >=0.6.2\n  run:\n    - libmujoco >=3.12\n  ignore_run_exports:\n    from_package:\n      - libmujoco\n\ntests:\n  - package_contents:\n      files:\n        - if: linux\n          then: bin/mujoco_plugin/libmujoco_robotics_uri.so\n        - if: osx\n          then: bin/mujoco_plugin/libmujoco_robotics_uri.dylib\n        - if: win\n          then: Library/bin/mujoco_plugin/mujoco_robotics_uri.dll\n  - script: python -m pytest tests/test_provider.py -v\n    requirements:\n      run:\n        - python\n        - pytest\n        - mujoco >=3.12\n    files:\n      source:\n        - tests/test_provider.py\n\nabout:\n  homepage: https://github.com/gbionics/mujoco-robotics-uri\n  summary: MuJoCo resource provider for package, model, and robot URIs\n  description: |\n    A native MuJoCo resource provider that resolves package://, model://, and\n    robot:// URIs with resolve-robotics-uri-cpp. The shared plugin binds to the\n    already-loaded MuJoCo runtime and requires no Python registration helper.\n  license: BSD-3-Clause\n  license_file:\n    - LICENSE\n  repository: https://github.com/gbionics/mujoco-robotics-uri\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - traversaro\n",
